  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/03/IMG_1462.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El Casal Jove de Onda se transform&oacute; anoche por una horas en el t&uacute;nel el terror, un cambio realizado con pl&aacute;sticos negros, luces de velas, viejos utensilios y, sobre todo, por varias personas caracterizadas como personajes terror&iacute;ficos que intentaban asustar a valientes j&oacute;venes.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1441.jpg\" alt=\"img_1441\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1442.jpg\" alt=\"img_1442\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1443.jpg\" alt=\"img_1443\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1444.jpg\" alt=\"img_1444\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1446.jpg\" alt=\"img_1446\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1447.jpg\" alt=\"img_1447\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1449.jpg\" alt=\"img_1449\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1451.jpg\" alt=\"img_1451\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nitterrorcasaljove/img_1454.jpg\" alt=\"img_1454\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4